  "title": "Hawthorn Bancshares Reports Third Quarter 2025 Results",
  "summary": "JEFFERSON CITY, Mo., Oct. 29, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Hawthorn Bancshares, Inc. (NASDAQ: HWBK) , (the “Company”), the bank holding company for Hawthorn Bank, reported third quarter 2025 net income of $6.1 million, or earnings per diluted share (“EPS”) of $0.88. Third Quarter 2025 Results Net income improved $1.6 million, or 34.1% , to $6.1 million from the third quarter 2024 (the \"prior year quarter\") and the efficiency ratio improved to 62.30% compared to 66.23% for the prior year quarter EPS o",
